&lt;p&gt;Sioux Area Metro is South Dakota’s largest transportation provider. Our mission is to have a positive social and economic impact on the community by providing a safe and reliable transportation option for all who live, work, or play in Sioux Falls.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;CDL Driver&lt;/strong&gt; at SAM by Via, you will drive buses and provide outstanding customer service to riders in the immediate Sioux Falls area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive buses in heavy or light city and highway traffic, in all conditions, and following all rules and regulations in a productive and timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safely and courteously, operate lift-equipped vehicles to transport elderly and/or disabled persons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn the fundamentals of SAM by Via operations and related safety procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform the routine operation of agency vehicles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess good knowledge of the city&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to follow written and verbal instruction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to operate a bus within standard safety guidelines to ensure public safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to deal effectively and courteously with all customers and the public&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold a valid SD driver’s license; Class B CDL with passenger and air brake endorsement is a plus. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We can train you to obtain one.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to pass a pre-employment physical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pass a drug screening and background check: no felonies, clean MVR, no DUI/DWI or reckless driving convictions, and no more than 2 speeding tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 25 years old&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to apply in person at the Sioux Area Metro office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final salary will be determined by the candidate’s experience, knowledge, and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary Range: Starting at $22.50/hour during training/probation with increases up to $25.00&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefits include health, dental, and life insurance, 401K with up to 6% company match, holiday pay, vacation, and bonus days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012, Via pioneered the TransitTech category by using new technologies to develop public mobility systems — optimizing networks of buses, shuttles, wheelchair accessible vehicles, school buses, autonomous vehicles, and electric vehicles around the globe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building the world&#39;s most efficient, equitable, and sustainable transportation network for all passengers — including those with limited mobility, those without smartphones, and unbanked populations — Via works with its partners to lower the costs of public transit while providing transportation options that rival the convenience of a personal car while reducing environmental impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the intersection of transportation and technology, Via is a visionary market leader that combines software innovation with sophisticated service design and operational expertise to fundamentally improve the way the world moves, providing technology in 650 communities and more than 35 countries and counting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to join the ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Via is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Via has the mission to improve transportation and mobility around the world. From changing a single person’s daily commute to reducing humanity’s collective environmental footprint — we’ve got huge goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;City Operations Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;on Via’s Operations team, you are the force that keeps our services running reliably for the communities that depend on them. This is a high-ownership, boots-on-the-ground role where you’ll lead the daily operations of our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.omnibusrevue.de/nachrichten/management/on-demand-verkehre-rmv-verzeichnet-drei-millionen-fahrgaeste-3676206&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;on-demand RMV services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; across the greater Frankfurt area, tackle real-time challenges, drive optimization, and ensure our riders are transported safely and reliably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A big part of the role is optimizing how our field team and service operate: using data to quickly answer operational questions, identify opportunities, improve processes, and lead AI and automation projects. You’ll have a unique opportunity to combine hands-on operations with innovation and help shape the future of on-demand passenger transportation in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based in the greater Frankfurt area, with the expectation that you will be on-site at least 3 days per week&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run daily onsite operations, ensuring safe, reliable, and accessible transportation for our riders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous optimization across the field team and service, leveraging data, technology, AI, and automation — including leading AI projects from idea to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make real-time decisions on fleet, driver supply, compliance, rider needs, and unexpected issues — using data to quickly diagnose problems and keep service running smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and support drivers, building strong relationships and identifying opportunities to improve field team performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn rider and community feedback into actionable improvements, using data to spot patterns and address root causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the bridge between Via&#39;s partners, drivers, and Via central teams, quickly pulling data to answer questions, solve problems, and drive improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operationally experienced&lt;/strong&gt; in people management, logistics, customer service, or other process-oriented work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship-oriented&lt;/strong&gt; and a strong communicator, able to build trust with drivers, riders, teammates, and city partners and find the right tone at every level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on and proactive&lt;/strong&gt;, comfortable taking responsibility for employees, being in the field, and solving problems where they happen — even under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven, structured, and digitally savvy,&lt;/strong&gt; using analytics and AI tools to solve problems, prioritize effectively, and improve our services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tactical and strategic&lt;/strong&gt;, able to tackle issues in real time while thinking ahead and building solutions that prevent them from recurring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proficiency level of at least C1 in both German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a valid drivers license in Germany, class B.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base salary range: €45-55k. Final salary will be determined by the candidate’s experience, knowledge, and skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international team, who stands for social impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme (bAV) with a 20% employer contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sports Club membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of vacation per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There has never been a more exciting time to be on the cutting edge of public mobility. Ready to join the ride?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Via is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Via hat die Mission, Mobilität auf der ganzen Welt zu verbessern. Von der Optimierung des täglichen Arbeitswegs einer einzelnen Person bis hin zur Verringerung des ökologischen Fußabdrucks der Menschheit – wir haben große Ziele.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;City Operations Manager (m/w/d)&lt;/strong&gt; im Operations-Team von Via bist Du die treibende Kraft, die unsere Services für die Menschen, die auf sie angewiesen sind, zuverlässig am Laufen hält. Dies ist eine Rolle mit hoher Eigenverantwortung und direktem Bezug zum operativen Geschäft, in der Du das Tagesgeschäft unserer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.omnibusrevue.de/nachrichten/management/on-demand-verkehre-rmv-verzeichnet-drei-millionen-fahrgaeste-3676206&quot;&gt;On-Demand-RMV-Services&lt;/a&gt; im Großraum Frankfurt leitest, Herausforderungen in Echtzeit löst und sicherstellst, dass unsere Fahrgäste sicher und zuverlässig befördert werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ein wichtiger Teil der Rolle ist die Optimierung unseres Field-Teams und Services: Du nutzt Daten, um operative Fragen schnell zu beantworten, Potenziale zu identifizieren, Prozesse zu verbessern und KI- sowie Automatisierungsprojekte zu leiten. Du hast die einzigartige Möglichkeit, operatives Tagesgeschäft mit Innovation zu verbinden und die Zukunft der On-Demand-Personenbeförderung in der Region aktiv mitzugestalten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diese Rolle ist im Großraum Frankfurt angesiedelt - wir erwarten, dass Du mindestens 3 Tage pro Woche vor Ort bist.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du führst das tägliche operative Geschäft und sorgst für sicheren, zuverlässigen und barrierefreien Transport für unsere Fahrgäste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du treibst die kontinuierliche Optimierung von Field-Team und Service voran – durch Daten, Technologie, KI und Automatisierung, inklusive der Leitung von KI-Projekten von der Idee bis zur Umsetzung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du triffst Echtzeit-Entscheidungen zu Fuhrpark, Fahrerverfügbarkeit, Compliance, Fahrgastbedürfnissen und unerwarteten Problemen – und nutzt Daten, um Probleme schnell zu diagnostizieren und den Service am Laufen zu halten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du begleitest und unterstützt unser Fahrpersonal, baust starke Beziehungen auf und identifizierst Möglichkeiten zur Verbesserung der Team-Performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du wandelst Feedback von Fahrgästen und Community in konkrete Verbesserungen um, indem du mithilfe von Daten Muster erkennst und Ursachen angehst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist das Bindeglied zwischen Via&#39;s Partnern, Fahrpersonal und zentralen Via-Teams, ziehst schnell Daten heran, um Fragen zu beantworten, Probleme zu lösen und Verbesserungen voranzutreiben.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bringst Du mit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst operative Erfahrung im Personalmanagement, in der Logistik, im Kundenservice oder anderen prozessorientierten Tätigkeitsfeldern mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist beziehungsorientiert und ein starker Kommunikator, der Vertrauen zu Fahrpersonal, Fahrgästen, Teamkolleg:innen und städtischen Partnern aufbaut und auf jeder Ebene den richtigen Ton trifft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist hands-on und proaktiv, übernimmst gerne Verantwortung für Mitarbeitende, bist gerne im operativen Geschäft unterwegs und löst Probleme dort, wo sie entstehen – auch unter Druck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest datengetrieben, strukturiert und digital versiert, nutzt Analyse- und KI-Tools, um Probleme zu lösen, effektiv zu priorisieren und unsere Services zu verbessern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du denkst taktisch wie strategisch, kannst Probleme in Echtzeit lösen und gleichzeitig vorausschauend Lösungen entwickeln, die ein erneutes Auftreten verhindern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über Sprachkenntnisse in Deutsch und Englisch auf mindestens C1-Niveau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast einen gültigen deutschen Führerschein der Klasse B.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergütung &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gehaltsspanne: zwischen 45.000 und 55.000 € pro Jahr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein internationales Team, das für sozialen Nutzen steht&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge (bAV) mit 20 % Arbeitgeberzuschuss&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitgliedschaft im Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 Urlaubstage pro Jahr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Es gab noch nie einen spannenderen Zeitpunkt, um an der Spitze der öffentlichen Mobilität zu stehen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bereit für die Fahrt?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wir wertschätzen Vielfalt und begrüßen alle Bewerbungen unabhängig von Geschlecht, Nationalität, ethnischer und sozialer Herkunft, Religion/Weltanschauung, Behinderung, Alter sowie sexueller Orientierung und Identität.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Via is on a mission to create public transportation systems that provide far greater access to jobs, healthcare, and education. Our platform serves as the technology backbone for modern transport, transforming antiquated and siloed public transportation systems into smart, data-driven, and efficient digital networks. With hundreds of agency partners around the world, Via is recognized as the leading transportation technology and service provider globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Commercial Director, UK &amp;amp; Nordics&lt;/strong&gt; at Via, you will be the driving force behind how cities rethink and deliver public transport. You’ll own Via’s commercial strategy in the region, lead the full end-to-end sales cycle, and build lasting partnerships with authorities, transport operators, and key public and private-sector leaders. Our Partnerships team combines hands-on execution with strategic thinking to help communities move more efficiently, sustainably, and equitably, while delivering on revenue targets and positioning Via as a trusted partner and visible voice across the mobility ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full-cycle commercial strategy across the UK &amp;amp; Nordics, from identifying and engaging prospective partners to structuring, negotiating, and closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted, long-term relationships with decision-makers, from elected officials and &lt;a href=&quot;https://ridewithvia.com/news/transport-for-west-midlands-expands-and-modernises-demand-responsive-transport-with-via&quot;&gt;transport authorities&lt;/a&gt; to transport operators, positioning Via as a strategic partner and helping cities and regions turn mobility ambitions into tangible systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex regional buying landscapes by leveraging Via’s full platform, including &lt;a href=&quot;https://ridewithvia.com/news/lincolnshire-county-council-partners-with-citymapper-to-enhance-public-transport-across-the-county&quot;&gt;Citymapper&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://ridewithvia.com/resources/tfgm-innovates-with-remix&quot;&gt;Remix&lt;/a&gt;, to develop evidence-based business cases that demonstrate value to cities and regions, unlock funding, and bring regional transit plans to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a thought partner to councils and regions, advising on network design, funding mechanisms, and implementation strategies that ensure communities benefit from more efficient, sustainable, and equitable transportation (E.g. &lt;a href=&quot;https://ridewithvia.com/resources/better-drt-technology-is-just-the-beginning.-integrating-tech-and-operations-is-the-next-frontier-for-cost-effective-services&quot;&gt;Milton Keynes&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://ridewithvia.com/resources/north-of-bristol-drt-patronage-grew-30-in-1-month.-how-by-choosing-via-to-handle-drt-operations&quot;&gt;WECA&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Via externally in your market, championing our mission and technology through local marketing efforts, conferences, and thought leadership: showing stakeholders how &lt;a href=&quot;https://ridewithvia.com/resources/better-drt-technology-is-just-the-beginning.-integrating-tech-and-operations-is-the-next-frontier-for-cost-effective-services&quot;&gt;innovative mobility&lt;/a&gt; can shape the future of urban living.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience closing complex, consultative deals in sales, business development, or strategy (ideally in enterprise, government, infrastructure, or tech-enabled services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of winning complex, multi-stakeholder deals where outcomes are driven by trust and influence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and storytelling skills; you know how to turn data, policy, and customer needs into a clear, compelling commercial narrative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, resourceful, and comfortable in ambiguity: you don’t wait for perfect information to start moving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural leader with excellent judgment: you know when to push, when to listen, and when to rethink the strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in high-ownership environments where you’re trusted to run your market like it’s your own business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in transportation, mobility, or public-sector sales is a big plus, but not a requirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Becoming part of a company that was awarded for its commitment to social good&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation including variable pay and equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid working model and a spacious office near Chancery Lane where you can enjoy weekly team lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive benefits package, including generous paid parental leave, and health scheme offered through AXA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnership with YellowNest, a salary exchange benefit that helps reduce childcare fees for working parents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme - multiple options via Green Commute Initiative (GCI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There has never been a more exciting time to be on the cutting edge of public mobility. Ready to join the ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Via is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
