&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an experienced product manager, with 7-10 years of experience in successful startups or large companies operating on a global scale.&lt;/li&gt;
