&lt;li&gt;You are able to digest market research &amp;amp; customer feedback along with having a crisp understanding of technical requirements and constraints to paint a vision of what a great product could look like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong understanding of how AI and emerging technologies can transform product experiences, and a track record of identifying and shipping AI-powered solutions that create meaningful value for users and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated success in handling an end-to-end product lifecycle with the ability to drive product planning, development, and launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical abilities and a strong business acumen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great multitasker who thrives in a dynamic, fast-paced work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
