&lt;li&gt;Be a thought partner to clients and the broader community: consult and educate on transit plans and funding opportunities, while championing Via’s mission as the face of our technology through local campaigns, conferences, and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in sales, business development, consulting, or advisory roles with a strong closing track record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative seller who knows how to use data to build compelling narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German (native-level) and English; persuasive and clear in conversations, presentations, and proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who thrives in fast-moving environments and knows how to balance persistence with pragmatism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team player who shares success and supports colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial intuition; persistent yet flexible in pursuing high-value opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
