&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Driver Growth Marketing Principal&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead top-of-funnel driver acquisition and sourcing strategies across North America. Bridging performance marketing, local brand presence, and community engagement, you will own candidate sourcing from awareness through initial application. You will champion recruiting safe, exceptional driver partners who serve as true brand and community ambassadors, helping expand accessible transit throughout North America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Data-Driven Sourcing &amp;amp; Spend Allocation:&lt;/strong&gt; Own multi-market driver acquisition budgets across paid digital (Meta, Google, Programmatic), hyper-local media (OOH, direct mail, radio), and community channels. Continuously monitor data-driven KPIs to scale applicant volume while aggressively reducing Cost Per Applicant (CPA) and Cost Per Hire (CPH).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruit Safe, High-Quality Community Ambassadors:&lt;/strong&gt; Craft performance marketing positioning, messaging, and sourcing tactics specifically tailored to identify, attract, and activate driver partners who uphold high standards of safety, service excellence, and community representation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute Supply-Side Experimentation &amp;amp; Media Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Formulate hypotheses and run rapid A/B and multivariate tests across creative messaging, audience targeting, landing pages, and referral incentives to establish playbooks that maximize driver conversion, retention, and lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze Funnel Dynamics &amp;amp; Operations Handoffs:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep-dive into driver conversion metrics across operational models to pinpoint drop-off bottlenecks and seasonal supply constraints, collaborating closely with the Driver Success team to ensure seamless handoffs from sourcing to onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Grassroots &amp;amp; Localized Playbooks:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with local workforce boards, community organizations, and municipal transit partners across North America to build grassroots driver-get-driver initiatives, local activation events, and high-converting candidate pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Performance Dashboards &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with analytics teams to build robust self-serve dashboards (Tableau / AI tools), tracking acquisition cohort health and reporting actionable funnel efficiency insights to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
