&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced professional with 6+ years of growth marketing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful, a problem solver who is motivated by high levels of ownership and the opportunity to have a measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem solver and continuous experimenter who challenges the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
