&lt;li&gt;Effective at managing multiple tasks simultaneously and comfortable taking on responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to wear multiple hats and work on projects of all types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator with the ability to adjust to a variety of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager and available to travel for field tests when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and &lt;strong&gt;German &lt;/strong&gt;(C2 or above) is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
