&lt;li&gt;Salary: $21.12 - $23.47/hour depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefits include health, dental, and life insurance, 401K, clothing allowance, holiday pay, vacation days, bonus days, and tool allowance&lt;/li&gt;
