&lt;li&gt;Relationship-oriented, earning trust from riders, accessibility advocates, teammates, and external partners through empathetic, clear communication and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on and proactive, eager to understand the end-to-end WAV rider journey firsthand and solve mobility challenges right where they happen.&lt;/li&gt;
