&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective at managing multiple complex, time-sensitive projects at once — taking ownership, working independently, and driving stakeholders toward deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and meticulous, with exceptional attention to detail and follow-through, and an eye for risks and dependencies before they become problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong problem solver who is comfortable in ambiguity and builds creative, practical solutions where no playbook exists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent communicator who builds strong relationships across employees, operational leaders, cross-functional partners, and senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and entrepreneurial, moving easily between strategic planning and the details required to keep a launch on track, while continuously improving processes and building scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of relevant experience in People Operations, HR, operations, project/program management, consulting, or another highly cross-functional environment, plus a Bachelor&#39;s degree and a record of strong academic and professional achievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting operational launches, frontline workforces, employee relations, labor relations, or complex workforce transitions is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
