&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base Salary Range: $150,000 - $220,000 per year plus variable pay and equity as part of a total compensation package. Final compensation will be determined by the candidate’s experience, knowledge, and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health coverage, with low-cost dental and vision plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 401(k) with company match and vesting&lt;/li&gt;
