&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Utility Worker&lt;/strong&gt; at Via, you will play a key role in maintaining the safety, efficiency, and functionality of our &lt;strong&gt;fully electric vehicle fleet&lt;/strong&gt; in West Palm Beach. This is a hands-on role ideal for someone who takes pride in keeping operations running smoothly through a wide range on the ground tasks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daytime Utility Worker&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;is primarily responsible for intraday vehicle charging, moving vehicles to support daytime operational needs, and other tasks to keep our fleet in top shape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shifts are estimated to be between 11am to 8pm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overnight Utility Worker&lt;/strong&gt; is primarily responsible for overnight charging operations, coordinating vehicle cleaning, and ensuring the fleet is ready for morning service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shifts are estimated to be between the hours of 8pm to 5am.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor vehicle charge levels and maneuver vehicles to chargers as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support overall fleet health by coordinating repairs and preventative maintenance; shuttling vehicles to/from vendors; inspecting vehicles for cleanliness, readiness and visual appearance and track out-of-service vehicles to optimize fleet supply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform smaller maintenance tasks (e.g., tire swaps, light repairs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the operations team with miscellaneous on-the-ground responsibilities, including maintaining and/or adjusting vehicle equipment and trade dress equipment, organizing workspaces, and assisting with local market initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take initiative, solve problems on the fly, and love getting the job done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic team player who is willing to wear multiple hats and tackle projects of all types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented enough to keep track of vehicle schedules, yet hands-on enough to jump into a repair&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable driving and maneuvering minivans and larger cutaway-sized vehicles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of basic vehicle mechanics and diagnostics is preferred (not mandatory)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be at least 21 years old with a valid driver’s license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful completion of a drug test, criminal background check, and motor vehicle records check is mandatory. This includes a clean Motor Vehicle Record (MVR) with no felonies, no DUI/DWI or reckless driving convictions, and no more than 2 speeding tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daytime Shift: $18-$20 per hour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overnight Shift: $20 - $22 per hour&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are proud to offer a generous and comprehensive benefits package for full-time employees, including health and retirement benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work flexible hours, including evenings, weekends, and overnight shifts as required for charging operations&lt;/li&gt;
